{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CfrxMGGHZiPUWHbvU4ozT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fixed. `get_metadata_for_wheel` now reads the wheel's own `{name}-{version}.dist-info/METADATA`, derived from the wheel filename, instead of the first `.dist-info/METADATA` in the zip. The PEP 658 test file passes (10/10), and ruff lint and format are clean.\n\n**The change (`src/fromager/candidate.py`)**\n- New helper `_wheel_metadata_path(url)` takes the filename from the URL path, validates it with `packaging.utils.parse_wheel_filename`, and returns `{name}-{version}.dist-info/METADATA`.\n- I use the raw name and version from the filename rather than the normalized values `parse_wheel_filename` returns. Normalization turns `_` into `-`, which would produce the wrong directory for names like `foo_bar`.\n- The fallback path reads that exact member and raises `ValueError` if it is missing. It no longer scans the archive.\n- The PEP 658 `.metadata` path is unchanged.\n\n**Tests (`tests/test_pep658_support.py`)**\n- `test_get_metadata_ignores_vendored_dist_info`: the zip has a vendored `vendored_lib-2.0.0.dist-info` entry first, followed by the wheel's own. It asserts the wheel's metadata is returned. The old code returns `vendored-lib` here, so this fails before the fix.\n- `test_get_metadata_raises_when_wheel_dist_info_missing`: when only a vendored dist-info exists, it raises rather than using the vendored metadata.\n\n**Not done**\n- I did not run mypy. The `mypy` on PATH is broken (`No module named 'mypy'`), and the venv has no mypy.\n- I did not run the full test suite, per the project's guidance for small changes.\n- I did not commit. The changes are in the working tree on `master`. The project asks for `git commit --signoff`, and I can prepare the commit message for your approval if you want it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4675,"cache_read_input_tokens":71528,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4675},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b9947c31-e532-4921-8984-d50c01326e03","uuid":"e1029c15-e81f-45f6-8b11-0cddf497c120","timestamp":"2026-10-09T16:10:25.545Z","request_id":"req_011CfrxMFxBam9NCvhsyu96H"}
